名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">姑妈；姨妈；婶婶；舅妈；伯母（对父母的姐妹或叔伯舅之妻的亲切称呼）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227572\"><ruby>叔母<rp>(</rp><rt>おば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんを<ruby>訪<rp>(</rp><rt>たず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ねた<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>とき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすごいごちそうだったね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看见叔叔的时候,吃得很棒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お昼</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おひる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">午餐；午饭；正午；中午；白天；日间；起床；起身；醒来</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226821\">お<ruby>昼<rp>(</rp><rt>ひる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をおごってくれたのを<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えてますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你还记得你给了我午餐吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">帯</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おび</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">腰带（和服用）；书腰（套于书籍、CD等外侧的纸带）；带；带状物；条形物；带状结构；环带；带状节目（每天固定时段播出的广播或电视节目）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怯える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おびえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">感到害怕；恐惧；惧怕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"212162\">その<ruby>音<rp>(</rp><rt>おと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ん<ruby>坊<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はおびえた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个声音让宝宝感到害怕。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夥しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おびただしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">数量众多；不计其数；极多；庞大；丰富</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227561\">おびただしい<ruby>数<rp>(</rp><rt>かず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>人々<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>集<rp>(</rp><rt>あつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まってきていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可怕的人聚集在一起。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">帯びる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おびる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">佩戴；携带；承载；被委以；被赋予；承担；具有；带有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"206407\">その<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>性格<rp>(</rp><rt>せいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>帯<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>び<ruby>始<rp>(</rp><rt>はじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个问题开始带来新的性格。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">オフィス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">办公室；办公处</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227555\">オフィスに<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぴったりについた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我们准时到达了办公室。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/907339\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お風呂</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おふろ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">洗澡；浴缸</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"158918\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はほとんど<ruby>毎日<rp>(</rp><rt>まいにち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>お<ruby>風呂<rp>(</rp><rt>ふろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>入<rp>(</rp><rt>はい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我几乎每天都在洗澡。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お弁当</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おべんとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">便当；日式盒装午餐</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">覚え</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おぼえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记忆；感觉；经验</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"154205\"><ruby>以前<rp>(</rp><rt>いぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>どこかで<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>会<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えがある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我记得以前在某个地方见过他。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">覚える</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おぼえる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记住；记忆；铭记；背下来；学习；学会；掌握；感到；感受；认为；看作；视为</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"122337\"><ruby>日本語<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>外人<rp>(</rp><rt>がいじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にとって<ruby>覚<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えにくい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">日本语对外国人很难记住。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">溺れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おぼれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">溺水；沉入水中无法呼吸；快要淹死；沉溺于；为某事物失去理智；上瘾；沉湎于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"90622\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>危<rp>(</rp><rt>あや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うく<ruby>溺<rp>(</rp><rt>おぼ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れるところだった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她差点就溺水了。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8703962\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お参り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おまいり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">参拜；扫墓；礼拜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175019\"><ruby>元旦<rp>(</rp><rt>がんたん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>近所<rp>(</rp><rt>きんじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>神社<rp>(</rp><rt>じんじゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にお<ruby>参<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りする<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">新年里,有很多人来到邻居的神社。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまえ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">你；（神灵、贵人等）面前；御前</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"226919\">お<ruby>前<rp>(</rp><rt>まえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>娘<rp>(</rp><rt>むすめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>夫<rp>(</rp><rt>おっと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">让你成为女儿的丈夫。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おまけ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">赠品；附赠品；额外赠送物；免费赠品；折扣；优惠；减价；添加；点缀；渲染（如故事的情节）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104580\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>若<rp>(</rp><rt>わか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いし、おまけに、<ruby>二枚目<rp>(</rp><rt>にまいめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他是年轻的,他也是第二个。</span></div></li>"]